{
"_readme": [
"Aion 2 boss NPC ids -> English boss name and instance.",
"Source: Backend/src/data/aion2/bosses.json (facts only: names as shown by the game client, NPC ids).",
"The id is what the game sends when a monster appears (spawn frame, opcode 0x4136, u32 after the entity id and 3 type bytes) - verified on a Krao Cave run: 2300104 = Enhanced Harcon, 2300171 = Ultimate Berk.",
"Regenerate when bosses.json changes: see assets/aion2/npcs/README.md.",
"maxHp: the boss's full hit points (for hpScale \"party\" bosses, the hit points for ONE player: the real maximum is maxHp times the group size, 1 to 5). Source: spawn frames of recordings and the community server (Backend/src/content/bossHpSeed.json)."
],
